Breaks: ubuntu-kylin-software-center
Replaces: ubuntu-kylin-software-center
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Software maintenance management tools
 Kylin Software Center is a newly built software center client
 for Kylin. The aim is to improve localization experience. The
 applications and related data come from both Kylin
 repositories.
 .
 Features:
  * Categorized and selected applications for users
  * Newly designed user interface
  * Work with software center and hold special packages from
    Kylin archive

